### cake retrieve api
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/cakes/1/


### cake patch api
PATCH  http://127.0.0.1:8000/cakes/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Red Velvet",
    "description": "Yummy yummyyy",
    "price": 1500
}

### cake delete api
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/cakes/1/

### login api

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/login/
Content-Type: application/json


{
    "username": "user",
    "password": "user"
}

### register api

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "baijuu123@mailinator.com",
    "first_name": "nidha",
    "role": "user",
    "password": "nidha12334"
}
